{
 "name": "HL · Prospects · send (max 20 a day)",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Prospects: send slowly (Lesson 5.2)\nWeekdays 09:00: up to 20 emails a day in total (first emails, then follow-ups). Before every single send: look up the address in Suppression and skip if found. Gmail from the outreach subdomain, then a random 3 to 9 minute wait.\nOne follow-up after 5 working days, only if there's no reply and no STOP.\n\nTEST MODE is on in Config: every email goes to YOUR_TEST_INBOX. Turn it off only after the client approves the ICP, template and rules.\n\nCredentials: Google Sheets; Gmail (the outreach subdomain mailbox, never the main domain).\nPlaceholders: YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_TEST_INBOX.\nSuppression tab: email, reason, date.",
    "height": 400,
    "width": 500
   },
   "id": "fdb57e58-16a2-43fe-88b0-a13b7b5f5955",
   "name": "Note 1",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -560,
    -300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "rule": {
     "interval": [
      {
       "field": "cronExpression",
       "expression": "0 9 * * 1-5"
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "id": "15d6865c-3141-4670-888d-8e3b545cc496",
   "name": "Weekdays 09:00",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "mode": "manual",
    "assignments": {
     "assignments": [
      {
       "id": "2a7fe866-31fa-4134-bb3e-f4a58b4460a5",
       "name": "test_mode",
       "value": true,
       "type": "boolean"
      },
      {
       "id": "32bd1268-6e5e-47b9-a36b-3c15843b40e7",
